#. <CLT 4>そもそも、なんでモニターなんだ？
#. アナウンスだけでも良かったじゃないか。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Why do they even need all these monitors? A normal PA\n"
"announcement would work just as well...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…絵的に寂しいって事か？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe it's just to give us something to look at.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…この向こうで黒幕が…
#. だとしたら、そいつは何者なんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind's been on the other side of this thing,\n"
"watching us. But...who are they really?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0004 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0005 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
